      // 3. [?ë„ˆì§€ ë°¸ëŸ°?? ê³¼ë„??ê¸´ì¥ ?µì œ (?Œì•„??
      // êµê°? ê²½(SNS) ??§„(65+), ë¶ˆì•ˆ??Anxiety), ?ëŠ” BAI ?ìˆ˜ê°€ ?’ì? ê²½ìš° -> ê¸´ì¥ ?„í™” ?„ìš”
      if (result.hrv.sns > 65 || result.careType === CareType.BURNOUT || result.survey.bai >= 15) {
        productIds.add('energy_bal');
      }

      // 4. [?”ì˜¤ì¹´ë””] ?ë‡Œ ?¸ì???& ?”ê¸°??(?¬ìŠ¤?Œí‹°?œì„¸ë¦?
      // ì§‘ì¤‘??ê²°í•, ???¼ë¡œ???’ìŒ, ?ëŠ” ?ìœ„ê¶??„ì•½???„í•œ 'ì§‘ì¤‘?? ê´€ë¦???      if (result.careType === CareType.CONCENTRATION || result.hrv.brainScore < 75 || result.survey.concentrationScore < 12) {
        productIds.add('no_cardi');
      }

      // 5. [ë§ˆê·¸?¤ìŠ˜] ? ê²½/ê·¼ìœ¡ ?ˆì •
      // ? ì²´??ì¦ìƒ(?ˆë–¨ë¦??????ˆê±°?? ?ŒíŒŒ??High-Beta(ê¸´ì¥) ?Œê? ?’ì„ ??      if (result.hrv.dominantEEG === 'H-Beta' || result.hrv.stressResistance < 40) {
        productIds.add('magnesium');
      }

      return Array.from(productIds).map(id => PRODUCTS[id]).filter(Boolean);
    };

